    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Ensures matches redirect to the correct client" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Redirect from Screening Match to Client Dashboard</p>
            <p>Ensures that when a screening match is selected, the system redirects to the correct client dashboard and the client name matches the one from the screening list.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> High</p>
            <step>1) Visit `/processes/handle-screening`. 2) Get the first match's client name from the grid. 3) Click the link to open the client dashboard. 4) Verify the client name in the dashboard matches the match list. 5) Store the client location path for later tests.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• The dashboard displays the correct client name matching the screening match record.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
